  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To review the literature related to women&#x2019;s financial inclusion: academic studies; programme reviews/evaluations; donor policy and guidance material.To produce a manual on how to design, manage, monitor and evaluate interventions to increase women&#x2019;s financial inclusion. The manual should include guidance on i) assessing and maximising the value for money of interventions, and ii) increasing the effectiveness of women&#x2019;s financial inclusion as a means for empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
